xlabel("w(1,:)"); %[output:4bbfce83]
ylabel("Cost function, J(w,b)"); %[output:4bbfce83]
ylim([min(J) max(J)/1000]) %[output:4bbfce83]
xlim([0.1 0.3]) %[output:4bbfce83]
%[text] You can see from the figures that $w\_1$ is decreasing without crossing the minimum. This solution will also converge, though not quite as quickly as the previous example.
